{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/algebraic-foundations/linear-equations-inequalities/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/algebraic-foundations/linear-equations-inequalities.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Mathematics - Linear Equations & Inequalities","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"accent-gradient text-white sticky top-0 z-40\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex items-center justify-between\">\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/algebraic-foundations/\" class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"p-2 bg-white/20 rounded-lg\"><span class=\"mi -equals\" data-mi=\"help_outline\">help_outline</span></div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Linear Equations &amp; Inequalities</div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs opacity-80\">Solving, graphing, and understanding inequalities</div>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"text-sm opacity-90\">Progress: <span id=\"progress\">0%</span></div>\n        <a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/\" class=\"text-white/90 hover:text-white text-sm\">Back to Math</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-8\">\n    <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\">\n      <aside class=\"lg:col-span-1\">\n        <div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl card-glow sticky top-24\">\n          <h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-3\">Contents</h3>\n          <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\">\n            <li><a href=\"#definition\" class=\"hover:text-indigo-600 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"step-badge\">1</span>Definition</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#methods\" class=\"hover:text-indigo-600 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"step-badge\">2</span>Key Methods</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#examples\" class=\"hover:text-indigo-600 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"step-badge\">3</span>Examples</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#practice\" class=\"hover:text-indigo-600 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"step-badge\">4</span>Practice</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </aside>\n\n      <section class=\"lg:col-span-3 space-y-6\">\n        <article id=\"definition\" class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl card-glow\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-3xl text-indigo-600 mt-1\"><span class=\"mi -info-circle\" data-mi=\"info\">info</span></div>\n            <div>\n              <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-2\">What are Linear Equations &amp; Inequalities?</h2>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-700\">A <strong>linear equation</strong> is an equation where the variable (like x) has no exponent higher than 1. It graphs as a straight line. Example: 2x + 3 = 7.<br><br>\n                An <strong>inequality</strong> compares two values using &lt;, &gt;, ≤, or ≥ instead of =. Example: x + 4 &gt; 10.</p>\n              <div class=\"mt-3 text-sm bg-blue-50 p-2 rounded border-l-4 border-blue-400\">\n                <strong>Tip:</strong> Solving means finding the value of x that makes the equation or inequality true.\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article id=\"methods\" class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl card-glow\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-3xl text-indigo-600 mt-1\"><span class=\"mi -tools\" data-mi=\"handyman\">handyman</span></div>\n            <div class=\"w-full\">\n              <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">Key Methods</h2>\n\n              <!-- Accordion: Solving Linear Equations -->\n              <div class=\"border rounded-lg mb-3\">\n                <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full text-left p-4 font-semibold flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-gray-50\" data-accordion=\"m1\">\n                  <span>1. Solving Linear Equations</span>\n                  <span class=\"mi -chevron-down\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n                </button>\n                <div class=\"accordion-content\" id=\"m1\">\n                  <div class=\"p-4 pt-0 text-gray-700 bg-gray-50\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">Isolate x by undoing addition/subtraction and then multiplication/division.</p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">Example: Solve 2x + 3 = 7<br>\n                      </p><ol class=\"list-decimal ml-4\">\n                        <li>Subtract 3 from both sides: 2x = 4</li>\n                        <li>Divide both sides by 2: x = 2</li>\n                      </ol>\n                    <p></p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm bg-blue-50 p-2 rounded border-l-4 border-blue-400\">Tip: Always do the same thing to both sides to keep the equation balanced.</div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Accordion: Graphing Linear Equations -->\n              <div class=\"border rounded-lg mb-3\">\n                <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full text-left p-4 font-semibold flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-gray-50\" data-accordion=\"m2\">\n                  <span>2. Graphing Linear Equations</span>\n                  <span class=\"mi -chevron-down\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n                </button>\n                <div class=\"accordion-content\" id=\"m2\">\n                  <div class=\"p-4 pt-0 text-gray-700 bg-gray-50\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">A linear equation like y = mx + b graphs as a straight line. m is the slope, b is the y-intercept.</p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">Example: y = 2x + 1 has slope 2 and crosses y-axis at 1.</p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm bg-blue-50 p-2 rounded border-l-4 border-blue-400\">Tip: Plot two points and draw a line through them.</div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Accordion: Solving Inequalities -->\n              <div class=\"border rounded-lg mb-3\">\n                <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full text-left p-4 font-semibold flex justify-between items-center hover:bg-gray-50\" data-accordion=\"m3\">\n                  <span>3. Solving Inequalities</span>\n                  <span class=\"mi -chevron-down\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n                </button>\n                <div class=\"accordion-content\" id=\"m3\">\n                  <div class=\"p-4 pt-0 text-gray-700 bg-gray-50\">\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">Solve just like equations, but remember: if you multiply or divide by a negative, flip the inequality sign.</p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-2\">Example: Solve -2x &lt; 6<br>\n                      </p><ol class=\"list-decimal ml-4\">\n                        <li>Divide both sides by -2: x &gt; -3 (sign flips!)</li>\n                      </ol>\n                    <p></p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm bg-blue-50 p-2 rounded border-l-4 border-blue-400\">Tip: Always flip the sign when multiplying/dividing by a negative.</div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article id=\"examples\" class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl card-glow\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-3xl text-indigo-600 mt-1\"><span class=\"mi -lightbulb\" data-mi=\"lightbulb\">lightbulb</span></div>\n            <div>\n              <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">Worked Examples (step-by-step)</h2>\n              <div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-gray-700\">\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">Example 1: Solve 3x - 5 = 10</div>\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm\">\n                    <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside ml-3 space-y-1\">\n                      <li>Add 5 to both sides: 3x = 15</li>\n                      <li>Divide both sides by 3: x = 5</li>\n                      <li>Final answer: <span class=\"bg-green-50 px-2 py-1 rounded\">x = 5</span></li>\n                    </ol>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">Example 2: Graph y = -x + 2</div>\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm\">\n                    <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside ml-3 space-y-1\">\n                      <li>Slope is -1, y-intercept is 2</li>\n                      <li>Plot (0,2) and (1,1)</li>\n                      <li>Draw a straight line through the points</li>\n                    </ol>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">Example 3: Solve 2x + 4 ≥ 10</div>\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm\">\n                    <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside ml-3 space-y-1\">\n                      <li>Subtract 4: 2x ≥ 6</li>\n                      <li>Divide by 2: x ≥ 3</li>\n                      <li>Final answer: <span class=\"bg-green-50 px-2 py-1 rounded\">x ≥ 3</span></li>\n                    </ol>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">Example 4: Solve -x &lt; 7</div>\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 text-sm\">\n                    <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside ml-3 space-y-1\">\n                      <li>Divide by -1 (flip sign): x &gt; -7</li>\n                      <li>Final answer: <span class=\"bg-green-50 px-2 py-1 rounded\">x &gt; -7</span></li>\n                    </ol>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article id=\"practice\" class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl card-glow\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-3xl text-indigo-600 mt-1\"><span class=\"mi -pencil-alt\" data-mi=\"edit\">edit</span></div>\n            <div class=\"w-full\">\n              <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">Practice Problems</h2>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Type answers and press Check. Hints available.</p>\n\n              <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded-md bg-gray-50\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">1) Solve for x</div>\n                  <div class=\"font-mono text-indigo-700\">x + 7 = 12</div>\n                  <input id=\"p1\" class=\"mt-3 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., x=5\">\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"c1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded text-sm\">Check</button><button id=\"h1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-white border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n                  <div id=\"fb1\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded-md bg-gray-50\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">2) Solve for x</div>\n                  <div class=\"font-mono text-indigo-700\">2x - 3 = 9</div>\n                  <input id=\"p2\" class=\"mt-3 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., x=6\">\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"c2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded text-sm\">Check</button><button id=\"h2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-white border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n                  <div id=\"fb2\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded-md bg-gray-50\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">3) Solve the inequality</div>\n                  <div class=\"font-mono text-indigo-700\">x - 2 &lt; 5</div>\n                  <input id=\"p3\" class=\"mt-3 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., x<7\">\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"c3\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded text-sm\">Check</button><button id=\"h3\" class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-white border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n                  <div id=\"fb3\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded-md bg-gray-50\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">4) Solve the inequality</div>\n                  <div class=\"font-mono text-indigo-700\">-3x ≥ 9</div>\n                  <input id=\"p4\" class=\"mt-3 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., x<=-3\">\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"c4\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded text-sm\">Check</button><button id=\"h4\" class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-white border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n                  <div id=\"fb4\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm\"></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"mt-6 pt-4 border-t\">\n                <h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Independent Practice</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-2\">Try this challenge:</p>\n                <label class=\"block text-sm\">Problem: <code class=\"font-mono\">2(x - 3) &lt; 8</code></label>\n                <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-3\">\n                  <input id=\"ind\" class=\"p-2 border rounded w-60\" placeholder=\"Final answer\">\n                  <button id=\"checkInd\" class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-green-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button>\n                </div>\n                <div id=\"fbInd\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm\"></div>\n                <button id=\"showIndSol\" class=\"text-xs mt-2 text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-700\">Show solution</button>\n                <div id=\"indSol\" class=\"mt-3 hidden p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded text-sm\"></div>\n              </div>\n\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <button id=\"quizBtn\" class=\"fixed bottom-8 right-8 z-50 bg-indigo-600 text-white px-5 py-3 rounded-full shadow-lg hover:bg-indigo-700 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"mi -bolt\" data-mi=\"bolt\">bolt</span> Quiz</button>\n\n  <div id=\"quizModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 z-50 flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-2xl max-w-lg w-full p-6 relative\">\n      <button id=\"closeQuiz\" class=\"absolute top-3 right-4 text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 text-2xl\">×</button>\n      <div id=\"quizContent\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <footer class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-6 text-sm text-gray-500\">Linear Equations &amp; Inequalities — interactive lesson</footer>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Linear Equations &amp; Inequalities | Mathematics</title>\n  \n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style> body{font-family:Inter, sans-serif}.content-card{-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);} </style>\n\n\n  <div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n    <nav class=\"mb-4\"><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/algebraic-foundations/\" class=\"text-blue-600\">← Back to Algebraic Foundations</a></nav>\n    <article class=\"content-card rounded-lg p-6\">\n      <h1 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Linear Equations &amp; Inequalities</h1>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Solving single-variable linear equations and simple inequalities; graphical interpretation of solutions.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Worked example</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-700\">Solve: 3x - 5 = 16 → 3x = 21 → x = 7.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Practice</h3>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside text-gray-700\">\n        <li>Solve: 2x + 3 = 11.</li>\n        <li>Solve inequality: 5 - 2x &gt; 1.</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Brief solutions</h3>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside text-gray-700\">\n        <li>x = 4.</li>\n        <li>5 - 2x &gt; 1 → -2x &gt; -4 → x &lt; 2.</li>\n      </ol>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-gray-100 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":["@keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0 } to { opacity: 1 } }\n    .card-glow { box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(99,102,241,0.06); animation: fadeIn 0.45s ease; }\n    .accent-gradient { background: linear-gradient(90deg,#6366f1,#06b6d4); }\n    .step-badge { background: rgba(99,102,241,0.08); color:#3730a3; padding:.25rem .5rem; border-radius:.5rem; font-weight:600; display:inline-block; width:24px; height:24px; text-align:center; font-size:.75rem }\n    .accordion-content { max-height:0; overflow:hidden; transition: max-height .28s ease }\n    .accordion-content.open { max-height:900px }","body{font-family:Inter, sans-serif}.content-card{-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":["#definition","#methods","#examples","#practice"]}